">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Piltastane</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:114-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Insert</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Insert</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:114-148
msgid ""
"3 seconds in Insert mode, Arrow Key inserts row/column, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span "
"class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>Arrow Key</kbd> "
"inserts cell"
msgstr ""
"3 sekund i innsetjingsmodus: piltast set inn rad/kolonne, <kbd>Ctrl</"
"kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>Piltast</"
"kbd> set inn celle"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:115-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:115-145
msgid ""
"3 seconds in Delete mode, Arrow key deletes row/column, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span "
"class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>Arrow key</kbd> merges "
"cell with neighboring cell"
msgstr ""
"3 sekund i slettemodus: piltast slettar rad/kolonne, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span "
"class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>piltast</kbd> slår "
"saman cella med nabocella"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:116-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td.p:116-235
msgid ""
"If no whole cell is selected, the text from the cursor to the end of the "
"current sentence is deleted. If the cursor is at the end of a cell, and no "
"whole cell is selected, the contents of the next cell are deleted."
msgstr ""
"Dersom inga heil celle er merkt, vert teksten frå skrivemerket til slutten "
"av den gjeldande setninga sletta. Dersom skrivemerket står på slutten av ei "
"celle, og inga heil celle er merkt, vert innhaldet i den neste cella sletta."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td.p:117-1
msgid ""
"If no whole cell is selected and the cursor is at the end of the table, the "
"paragraph following the table will be deleted, unless it is the last "
"paragraph in the document."
msgstr ""
"Dersom inga heil celle er merkt og markøren er ved slutten av tabellen, vert "
"avsnittet etter tabellen sletta dersom det ikkje er det siste avsnittet i "
"dokumentet."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td.p:118-1
msgid ""
"If one or more cells are selected, the whole rows containing the selection "
"will be deleted. If all rows are selected completely or partially, the "
"entire table will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Dersom éi eller fleire celler er merkte, vert heile rada markeringa er gjort "
"i, sletta. Dersom alle radene er heilt eller delvis merkte, vert heile "
"tabellen sletta."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.h2:123-9
msgid "Word processor functions"
msgstr "Teksthandsamingsfunksjonar"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:125-69
msgid "Insert footnote"
msgstr "Set inn fotnote"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:126-68
msgid "Insert endnote"
msgstr "Set inn sluttnote"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:127-71
#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:182-71
msgid "Insert comment"
msgstr "Set inn merknad"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:129-71
msgid "Insert soft hyphen"
msgstr "Set inn mjuk bindestrek"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:130-71
msgid "Insert non-breaking hyphen"
msgstr "Set inn hard bindestrek"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:132-77
msgid "Insert non-breaking space"
msgstr "Set inn hardt mellomrom"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:133-38
msgid "Insert line break"
msgstr "Set inn linjeskift"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:133-82
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Enter</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Enter</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:134-70
msgid "Manual page break"
msgstr "Manuelt sideskift"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:135-72
msgid "Column break (in multicolumnar text)"
msgstr "Spalteskift (i tekstar med fleire spalter)"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:136-38
msgid ""
"Insert new paragraph directly before or after a section, or before a table"
msgstr ""
"Set inn eit nytt avsnitt direkte framføre eller etter ein bolk eller "
"framføre ein tabell"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:136-139
#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:137-175
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Enter</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Enter</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:137-38
msgid ""
"Insert new paragraph without numbering inside a list. Does not work when the "
"cursor is at the end of the list."
msgstr ""
"Set inn eit nytt, unummerert avsnitt i ei liste. Verkar ikkje dersom "
"markøren er ved slutten av lista."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.h2:143-9
msgid "Navigating in Spreadsheets"
msgstr "Navigering i rekneark"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:145-38
msgid "Moves the cursor to the first cell in the sheet (A1)."
msgstr "Flyttar markøren til den første cella i arket (A1)."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:146-38
msgid "Moves the cursor to the last cell on the sheet that contains data."
msgstr "Flyttar markøren til den siste cella i arket som inneheld data."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:147-38
msgid "Moves the cursor to the first cell of the current row."
msgstr "Flyttar markøren til den første cella i den gjeldande rada."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:148-38
msgid "Moves the cursor to the last cell of the current row."
msgstr "Flyttar markøren til den siste cella i den gjeldande rada."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:149-38
msgid ""
"Selects cells from the current cell to the first cell of the current row."
msgstr ""
"Merkar cellene frå den gjeldande cella til den første cella i den gjeldande "
"rada."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:150-38
msgid ""
"Selects cells from the current cell to the last cell of the current row."
msgstr ""
"Merkar cellene frå den gjeldande cella til den siste cella i den gjeldande "
"rada."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:151-38
msgid ""
"Selects cells from the current cell up to one page in the current column or "
"extends the existing selection one page up."
msgstr ""
"Merkar cellene frå den gjeldande cella og ei side opp i den gjeldande "
"kolonnen, eller utvidar den gjeldande merkinga ei side opp."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:151-184
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:152-38
msgid ""
"Selects cells from the current cell down to one page in the current column "
"or extends the existing selection one page down."
msgstr ""
"Merkar cellene frå den gjeldande cella og ei side ned i den gjeldande "
"kolonnen, eller utvidar den gjeldande merkinga ei side ned."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:152-188
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:153-38
msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the left edge of the current data range. If the column "
"to the left of the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves "
"to the next column to the left that contains data"
msgstr ""
"Flyttar markøren til venstre kant av det gjeldande dataområdet. Om kolonnen "
"til venstre for cella med markøren er tom, flyttar markøren seg til den "
"neste kolonnen til venstre som inneheld data"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:153-265
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Left Arrow</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Pil venstre</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:154-38
msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the right edge of the current data range. If the column "
"to the right of the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves "
"to the next column to the right that contains data."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar markøren til høgre kant av det gjeldande dataområdet. Om kolonnen "
"til høgre for cella med markøren er tom, flyttar markøren seg til den neste "
"kolonnen til høgre som inneheld data."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:154-269
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Right Arrow</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Pil høgre</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:155-38
msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the top edge of the current data range. If the row above "
"the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves up to the next "
"row that contains data."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar markøren til øvre kant av det gjeldande dataområdet. Om rada over "
"cella med markøren er tom, flyttar markøren seg opp til den neste rada som "
"inneheld data."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:155-241
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Up Arrow</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Pil opp</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:156-38
msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the bottom edge of the current data range. If the row "
"below the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves down to "
"the next row that contains data."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar markøren til nedre kant av det gjeldande dataområdet. Om rada under "
"cella med markøren er tom, flyttar markøren seg ned til den neste rada som "
"inneheld data."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:156-246
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Down Arrow</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Pil ned</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:157-38
msgid "Go to next sheet."
msgstr "Gå til neste ark."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:157-82
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:158-38
msgid "Go to previous sheet."
msgstr "Gå til førre ark."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:158-86
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:159-38
msgid ""
"Selects all cells containing data from the current cell to the end of the "
"continuous range of data cells, in the direction of the arrow pressed. If "
"used to select rows and columns together, a rectangular cell range is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Merkar alle cellene som inneheld data, frå den gjeldande cella til slutten "
"av det samanhengande området med dataceller, i retninga til piltasten du "
"trykte. Om du brukar dette til å merka rader og kolonnar saman, vert eit "
"rektangulært celleområde merkt."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:159-292
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Arrow</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Pil</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:160-38
msgid "Moves one sheet to the left."
msgstr "Flyttar eitt ark til venstre."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:160-93
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:161-38
msgid "Moves one screen page to the right."
msgstr "Flyttar eitt skjermbilete til høgre."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:161-100
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:162-38
msgid ""
"Adds the previous sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the "
"sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only "
"selects the previous sheet. Makes the previous sheet the current sheet."
msgstr ""
"Legg det førre arket til det gjeldande utvalet av ark. Om alle arka i "
"reknearket er merkte, vel denne snøggtasten berre det førre arket. Gjer det "
"førre arket til det gjeldande arket."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:162-280
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Up</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:163-38
msgid ""
"Adds the next sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in "
"a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the "
"next sheet. Makes the next sheet the current sheet."
msgstr ""
"Legg det neste arket til det gjeldande utvalet av ark. Om alle arka i "
"reknearket er merkte, vel denne snøggtasten berre det neste arket. Gjer det "
"neste arket til det gjeldande arket."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:163-268
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Page Down</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:164-38
msgid "Selects the entire column of the current cell."
msgstr "Merkar heile kolonnen til den gjeldande cella."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:164-111
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Space</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Mellomrom</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:165-38
msgid "Selects the entire row of the current cell."
msgstr "Merkar heile rada til den gjeldande cella."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:165-108
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Space</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Mellomrom</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:166-38
msgid ""
"Opens the context menu of the focused sheet tab (insert, rename, delete, "
"hide, move, and more)."
msgstr ""
"Opnar sprettoppmenyen til arkfana som har fokus (set inn, endra namn, slett, "
"gøym, flytt og meir)."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:167-38
msgid ""
"With a whole column or row selected, opens the matching column or row header "
"context menu (insert, delete, width or height, hide, and more)."
msgstr ""
"Når ein heil kolonne eller ei heil rad er merkt, opnar dette sprettoppmenyen "
"til den tilsvarande kolonne- eller radoverskrifta (set inn, slett, breidd "
"eller høgd, gøym og meir)."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:168-38
msgid ""
"where (*) is the multiplication sign on the numeric key pad. Selects the "
"data range that contains the cursor. A range is a contiguous cell range that "
"contains data and is bounded by empty row and columns."
msgstr ""
"der (*) er multiplikasjonsteiknet på taltastaturet. Merkar dataområdet som "
"inneheld markøren. Eit område er eit samanhengande celleområde som inneheld "
"data og er avgrensa av tomme rader og kolonnar."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:168-269
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>*</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>*</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:169-38
msgid ""
"where (/) is the division sign on the numeric key pad. Selects the matrix "
"formula range that contains the cursor."
msgstr ""
"der (/) er divisjonsteiknet på taltastaturet. Merkar området til "
"matriseformelen som inneheld markøren."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:169-178
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>/</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>/</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:170-38
msgid "Insert cells (as in menu Insert - Cells)"
msgstr "Set inn celler (som i menyen Set inn – Celler)"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:170-105
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Plus key</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Plusstasten</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:171-38
msgid "Delete cells (as in menu Edit - Delete Cells)"
msgstr "Slett celler (som i menyen Rediger – Slett celler)"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:171-110
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Minus key</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Minustasten</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.h2:175-9
msgid "Cell formatting"
msgstr "Celleformatering"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:183-38
msgid "Display comment"
msgstr "Vis merknad"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:183-80
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>F1</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>F1</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:184-38
msgid "Fill Down"
msgstr "Fyll nedover"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:184-74
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>D</kbd>"
